          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} — compassionate wellness coaching focused on habits, rhythms, and lasting change.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fcfbfa; --ink:#1f2933; --muted:#6b7280; --accent:#6b8e94; --card:#ffffff; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\\n      --radius:12px; --gap:28px; --max:1100px;\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f7f8f9);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.45}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:48px auto;padding:0 24px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(235,242,240,0.6),transparent);padding:32px;border-radius:18px}\\n    .hero-content h2{margin:0;font-size:28px}\\n    .hero-content p{color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 18px}\\n    .hero-visual{display:flex;justify-content:center}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(32,40,45,0.06)}\\n    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:32px;margin-top:28px}\\n    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #e7eaeb;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    textarea{min-height:140px;resize:vertical}\\n    .submit{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2b7a6f,#4a9a9a);color:white;border:0;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .meta{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\\n    .proof{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .avatars{display:flex;gap:8px}\\n    .avatars img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,20,22,0.06)}\\n    .benefits-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .benefit{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbffff);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .process{margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .step{flex:1;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:12px}\\n    details{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    .final-cta{margin-top:28px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f0fbfa,#ffffff);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    footer{margin-top:48px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .benefits-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .process{flex-direction:column}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"avatar\\\" width=\\\"56\\\" height=\\\"56\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,20,22,0.06)\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-content\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Connect • Clarify • Commit</div>\\n        <h2>Reach Out & Begin Gentle Change</h2>\\n        <p>Schedule a brief conversation with {{COACH_NAME}} ({{CREDENTIALS}}) to map small daily habits into sustainable wellbeing. No jargon — just clear steps you can follow.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"submit\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Prefer email? <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> · Call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">I work remotely with clients in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and beyond. Sessions are confidential and focused on habits, rhythms, and measurable changes.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-visual\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"illustration\\\" width=\\\"380\\\" height=\\\"240\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(22,28,30,0.06)\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"contact-grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Send a note to {{COACH_NAME}}</h3>\\n          <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"First & last\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" required>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"interest\\\">I'm interested in</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n              <option>1:1 Coaching (habits & routines)</option>\\n              <option>VIP Day — focused reset</option>\\n              <option>Group Circle (small cohort)</option>\\n              <option>Other</option>\\n            </select>\\n\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Share a little about what you'd like support with\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"submit\\\">Request a call</button>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">We typically reply within 48 hours. If urgent, call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"padding:14px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n              <strong>Quick options</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">If you prefer, book a directly available slot or download a short intake to prepare for our call.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\\\">\\n              <a class=\\\"submit\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a call</a>\\n              <a class=\\\"submit\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Download intake</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Ripple of the site</h4>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">This page echoes the core site sections so you can orient quickly: hero, social proof, benefits, process, FAQ, and a lead magnet. Find the full context on the home page for programs and pricing.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">People who felt steadier</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"proof\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatars\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"client avatar\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"client avatar\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"client avatar\\\">\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Hundreds of hours of guided habit work, locally in {{CITY}} and online. See full stories on <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">A compact benefits snapshot</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefits-grid\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n                <strong>Practical habits</strong>\\n                <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:13px\\\">Micro-steps you can keep doing, not resolutions you abandon.</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n                <strong>Clear frameworks</strong>\\n                <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:13px\\\">Tools to measure progress and adapt with less friction.</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"benefit\\\">\\n                <strong>Gentle accountability</strong>\\n                <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:13px\\\">Support that honors your pace and values consistency over intensity.</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">How the process ripples</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"process\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>1 — Connect</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px\\\">A 20–30 minute call to clarify aims.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>2 — Plan</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px\\\">A short plan with weekly steps and check-ins.</div></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>3 — Integrate</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px\\\">Small changes become reliable habits.</div></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Frequent questions</h4>\\n            <details>\\n              <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">Is this medical care?</summary>\\n              <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">No. Coaching focuses on behaviors and systems. It is not a substitute for clinical or medical services.</p>\\n            </details>\\n            <details style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">What if I can't commit weekly?</summary>\\n              <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">We design options that fit your capacity — shorter check-ins, VIP days, or monthly reviews.</p>\\n            </details>\\n            <details style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">Do you offer sliding scale?</summary>\\n              <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Occasionally. Ask in your initial message and I can share current availability.</p>\\n            </details>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;text-align:right\\\"><a href=\\\"faq.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">More FAQ →</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"lead-magnet\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"pattern\\\" width=\\\"56\\\" height=\\\"56\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:10px\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>Free guide — '5 Tiny Habits for Calmer Days'</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px\\\">Get a simple, 2-week starter sequence to anchor a calmer routine. Delivered instantly.</div>\\n              <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n                <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"lead_email\\\" placeholder=\\\"your@email.com\\\" required>\\n                <button class=\\\"submit\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send</button>\\n              </form>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"final-cta\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>Ready to begin?</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">A focused first step, tailored to your life.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <a class=\\\"submit\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a clarity call</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{COACH_NAME}} ({{CREDENTIALS}}) • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Chunk 4 — Contact page and README\\n\\nThis bundle includes the site contact page (contact.html) tailored for a wellness coach and a README with instructions.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — A premium, lux_gallery-style contact page that echoes the core site sections (hero, social proof, benefits, process, FAQ, lead magnet, CTA) so the \\\"required section pack\\\" ripples to this page.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace (appear throughout contact.html):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nNotes & implementation details:\\n- The layout follows the \\\"lux_gallery\\\" family: large SVG visuals (referenced as local assets) and restrained motion-friendly, gallery-like sections.\\n- The copy uses a gentle_therapist voice: compassionate, practical, outcome-focused without medical claims. The VIP Day model is reflected in language (options include VIP Day and terse planning).\\n- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Replace with your processing endpoint or use a booking link like to a scheduling page.\\n- Local SVG references (expected to exist in the project):\\n  - assets/img/hero.svg\\n  - assets/img/avatar.svg\\n  - assets/img/pattern.svg\\n  Please create unique SVGs for each file (do not use external CDNs or copied shared assets).\\n\\nAccessibility & privacy:\\n- Form fields are labeled. The copy emphasizes confidentiality and response times.\\n- There are no analytics, external fonts, or third-party scripts in this chunk.\\n\\nNavigation:\\n- Header links point to the other project pages (index.html, about.html, programs.html, services.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html). Adjust labels or links as needed.\\n\\nCustomization tips:\\n- Swap colors in the :root CSS for brand adjustments. The design aims for a calm, premium palette.\\n- To add micro-interactions, include small, local JS files that progressively enhance forms (not included here).\\n\\nIf you need the other pages or the SVG assets created in this chunk, ask for the next bundle and specify any preferred color palette or illustrative style for the SVGs.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
